+            "finished. After dispatching, reply in one short sentence saying exactly "
+            "what the subagent is doing. The detached result will return to this "
+            f"Discord session automatically. Suggested worker kind: {worker_kind}.]\n\n"
+            f"{message_text}"
+        )
